e":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Since Batumi is also a seaport, you have to try the fish here! Head to the local Fish Market, buy some of your choice and take with you to your ho(s)tel, or let it be prepared at one of the many restaurants there. Preparation costs 3-5 lari, plus the fish 20-30 lari per kg. Salmon is quite cheap, flounder a little more expensive. Take some Ojakhuri or mashed potatoes with the fish. Btw. it is bett","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Batumi"},{"id":"batumi_wv_munich","areaId":"batumi","name":"Munich","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":41.65126,"lng":41.64181},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"batumi_wv_munich","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://www.facebook.com/munichinbatumi","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["munichbatumi","batumi"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"10:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"10:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"10:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"10:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"10:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"10:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"10:00","close":"23:59"}]},"summary":"Restaurant with German traditional cuisine. Pizza, Seafood and Vegan dishes are also served. Paying: Visa, American Express, Mastercard and Cash. Restaurant has open-air seats also. A bit overpriced.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Batumi"},{"id":"batumi_wv_sinner_s_bar_kitchen","areaId":"batumi","name":"Sinner's Bar & Kitchen","category":"nightlife","tags":["nightlife"],"location":{"lat":41.65144,"lng":41.63885},"visitMinutes":90,"photoSeed":"batumi_wv_sinner_s_bar_kitchen","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://www.sinners.ge/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["sinnersbarkitchen","batumi"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"15:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"15:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"15:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"15:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"16:00","close":"23:59"},nul